#: src/Privacy/class-privacy-tools.php:186
msgid "Cookies and tracking"
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy/class-privacy-tools.php:187
msgid ""
"The plugin does not set its own cookies and does not use tracking or "
"advertising services. Cart and checkout cookies are set by WooCommerce. "
"Request limits use a salted one-way hash of the visitor address (and, where "
"the address is not reliable, a random browser token kept in the browser's "
"local storage); these counters are kept for at most one hour. When you start "
"a donation without the cart, the unpaid order also stores such hashes so "
"that the number of unpaid orders per visitor can be limited; they are "
"removed from the order as soon as it is paid, put on hold or cancelled. A "
"salted hash of the random browser token stays on the order to protect "
"against duplicate submissions and is removed by the personal data eraser."
msgstr ""

